<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Meet Peter and Cassia and discover the story behind Coast2Road—life on the water, the road, and the places in between."
		/>
		<link rel="canonical" href="https://coast2road.pages.dev/about/" />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:site_name" content="Coast2Road" />
		<meta property="og:title" content="About Coast2Road | The Journey Matters" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="Meet Peter and Cassia and discover the story behind Coast2Road—life on the water, the road, and the places in between." />
		<meta property="og:url" content="https://coast2road.pages.dev/about/" />
		<meta property="og:image" content="https://coast2road.pages.dev/images/about-coast2road-title.png" />
		<meta property="og:image:alt" content="Passports, compass, map, boat and RV keepsakes representing the Coast2Road journey" />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content="About Coast2Road | The Journey Matters" />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content="Meet Peter and Cassia and discover the story behind Coast2Road." />
		<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://coast2road.pages.dev/images/about-coast2road-title.png" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<title>About Coast2Road | The Journey Matters</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header class="site-header">
			<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Coast2Road home">
				<img src="/images/coast2road-logo.svg" alt="" />
				<span><strong>coast<span>2</span>road</strong><em>The Journey Matters</em></span>
			</a>
			<a class="back-link" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back home</a>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
				<img src="/images/about-coast2road-title.png" alt="Passports, compass, map, boat and RV keepsakes representing the Coast2Road journey" />
				<div class="hero-shade"></div>
				<div class="hero-copy">
					<p>Our story</p>
					<h1 id="about-title">The journey is where the story begins.</h1>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="introduction" aria-labelledby="meet-title">
				<div class="section-label">
					<span></span>
					<p>Meet the people behind Coast2Road</p>
				</div>
				<div class="intro-copy">
					<h2 id="meet-title">We’re Peter and Cassia.</h2>
					<p class="lead">Maritime and education professionals with a shared curiosity about the world around us.</p>
					<p>Peter holds an unlimited master’s license, and Cassia holds a PhD, giving us two different perspectives shaped by life at sea, education, travel, and discovery.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="perspectives" aria-label="Our perspectives">
				<article>
					<span class="number">01</span>
					<div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 5v31M18 11h12M16 19h16M10 28c2 8 7 13 14 15 7-2 12-7 14-15M10 28h8M38 28h-8M21 5a3 3 0 1 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0-6 0Z"/></svg>
					</div>
					<p class="kicker">From the coast</p>
					<h2>Life on the water</h2>
					<p>Our professional lives give us a close view of the maritime world—the vessels, people, ports, and everyday moments that often pass unnoticed from shore.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span class="number">02</span>
					<div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M6 12h31c3 0 5 2 5 5v20H6V12ZM11 17h12v9H11zM28 17h9v9h-9zM31 31h6M12 37a4 4 0 1 0 8 0M31 37a4 4 0 1 0 8 0M6 29H3v6h3"/></svg>
					</div>
					<p class="kicker">To the road</p>
					<h2>Exploring beyond work</h2>
					<p>In our own time, we explore by boat and RV, travel to new places, try local food, visit museums, and follow whatever catches our curiosity.</p>
				</article>
			</section>

			<section class="why-section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
				<div class="compass-wrap">
					<img src="/images/coast2road-compass.svg" alt="" />
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="script">Why Coast2Road?</p>
					<h2 id="why-title">Sharing what we see along the way.</h2>
					<p>We created Coast2Road to share the places, people, and experiences we encounter—both through our work and in our own time.</p>
					<p>Sometimes that means life on the water. Other times it means exploring by RV, traveling somewhere new, discovering local food, visiting a museum, or simply paying attention to what is happening along the way.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="motto" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="motto-title">
				<p>The philosophy</p>
				<h2 id="motto-title">The Journey Matters</h2>
				<span></span>
				<blockquote>A destination may be the reason you leave home, but some of the most memorable experiences happen before you ever arrive.</blockquote>
				<p>If you slow down and pay attention, the journey itself often becomes the story.</p>
				<a href="/#logbook">Open the logbook <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="site-footer">
			<div>
				<a class="footer-brand" href="/">
					<img src="/images/coast2road-compass.svg" alt="" />
					<span><strong>coast<span>2</span>road</strong><em>The Journey Matters</em></span>
				</a>
				<p>© 2026 coast2road</p>
			</div>
			<a href="mailto:info@coast2road.com">info@coast2road.com</a>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
